      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003174",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "STATE\nCada estado decide qué transiciones admite\n(publicar, pausar, reanudar, cerrar, cancelar).\nSin él: un switch por estado en cada método.",
       "left": 1313,
       "top": 10967,
       "width": 286,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003175",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003098"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003174"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "1456:10967;1456:10859"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003176",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "STATE\nCada estado decide qué acciones admite\n(aceptar, pagar, iniciar, completar, cancelar).\nSin él: ifs de estado repartidos en Contratacion.",
       "left": 5542,
       "top": 10855,
       "width": 298,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003177",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003060"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003176"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "5745:10855;5867:10768;6152:10693;6168:10686"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003178",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "DECORATOR\nCada promoción envuelve al precio anterior;\nse acumulan en el orden en que se agregaron.\nSin él: un if por combinación de descuentos.",
       "left": 2574,
       "top": 10967,
       "width": 294,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003179",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003090"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003178"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "2732:10967;2782:10800;2788:10784"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003180",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "STRATEGY\nReintegro 100/50/0 % según anticipación (48 h / 24 h),\no total si cancela el proveedor.\nOtra política es otra clase: Contratacion no cambia.",
       "left": 10265,
       "top": 10855,
       "width": 338,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003181",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003063"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003180"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "10381:10855;10245:10757;10015:10754;9847:10679"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003182",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "SIMPLE FACTORY\nElige la política según quién cancela.\nQuien cancela no conoce las clases concretas.",
       "left": 10042,
       "top": 10611,
       "width": 295,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003183",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003064"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003182"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "10189:10611;10189:10309"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003184",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "STRATEGY\nAfinidad por habilidades o popularidad reciente.\nCambiar el criterio no toca BusquedaService.",
       "left": 8545,
       "top": 7569,
       "width": 299,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003185",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS002961"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003184"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "8735:7569;8933:7418"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003186",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "OBSERVER\nLos Services publican los eventos del dominio;\nlos suscriptores (NotificadorDeInteresados) reaccionan.\nSumar un suscriptor no cambia a quien publica.",
       "left": 8353,
       "top": 9130,
       "width": 344,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003187",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS002973"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003186"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "8525:9130;8525:9058"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003188",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "SIMPLE FACTORY\nElige el EnvioNotificacion según el canal del perfil\n(interna, email o push).",
       "left": 14793,
       "top": 7343,
       "width": 310,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003189",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS002975"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003188"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "14911:7343;14772:7228;14775:7212"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003190",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "ADAPTER\nAdapta el proveedor de email simulado a EnvioNotificacion\n(lo mismo PushAdapter y ServicioIdentidadSimulado).\nCambiar de proveedor no toca la aplicación.",
       "left": 16753,
       "top": 1191,
       "width": 364,
       "height": 76
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003191",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003127"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003190"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "16935:1191;16935:1113"
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteView",
       "_id": "SKS003192",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "text": "Contrato de la cátedra entre la UI y el backend:\nno se modifica. Lo que falta va en las\ninterfaces *Operaciones del equipo.",
       "left": 6658,
       "top": 3417,
       "width": 296,
       "height": 61
      },
      {
       "_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
       "_id": "SKS003193",
       "_parent": {
        "$ref": "SKS002902"
       },
       "head": {
        "$ref": "SKS003017"
       },
       "tail": {
        "$ref": "SKS003192"
       },
       "lineStyle": 1,
       "points": "6806:3417;6806:3218"
      },
